+    "Set counted_unit to individual_seizure, seizure_day, seizure_night, cluster, cluster_day, status_episode or not_applicable as the source warrants. Affected days or nights are not counts of individual seizures. Explicit seizures every night without a per-night event count measure affected seizure_nights; most nights does not imply an exact nightly rate. A named status-epilepticus episode count is status_episode, not individual seizures, attendances or rescue doses.",
